	## Goal
	Create a matrix view of coin performance to identify patterns.
	
	## Matrix Dimensions
	- Rows: Coins (BTC, ETH, SOL, DOGE, ZEC, BCH, LTC, etc.)
	- Columns: Datasets (chaos, dogdays, dreary, weekend, etc.)
	- Cells: Sharpe ratio (color-coded)
	
	## Additional Views
	- Volatility vs Sharpe scatter plot per coin
	- Win rate heatmap
	- Trade count heatmap
	- Best/worst coin per dataset
	
	## Questions to Answer
	- Which coins are consistently profitable?
	- Which datasets are hardest?
	- Are there coin clusters with similar behavior?
